      "text": "the generations of the heavens and of the earth, Gen. 2:4 (Moses 3:4; Abr. 5:4). book of the generations of Adam, Gen. 5:1 (D&C 98:28–30; 103:26; 105:30; Moses 6:8). feast to the Lord throughout your generations, Ex. 12:14. visiting the iniquity of the fathers upon … third and fourth generation, Deut. 5:9 (D&C 124:50). perverse and crooked generation, Deut. 32:5. generation that are pure in their own eyes, Prov. 30:12. One generation passeth away, and another generation cometh, Eccl. 1:4. who shall declare his generation, Isa. 53:8 (Acts 8:33; Mosiah 14:8; 15:10). his dominion is from generation to generation, Dan. 4:3.",
